title Home Assistant: the All tab (the last view): 0.1.0's lists: favourites, rooms with their count, Settings
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 700
shot all
check all
expect text "All"
expect text "FAVOURITES"
expect text "Ceiling light"
key end
wait 300
shot all-end
check all-end
expect text "Settings"
expect text "No room"
# Up from the first item reaches the tab bar, where Left goes back a view
key home
key up
key up
wait 300
shot all-bar
check all-bar
key left
wait 700
expect text "Living room"
expect noquit
